OL,3,ASales of tinned food and bottled water
OL,4,Ajump after 'Be Ready' campaign launch
OL,5,
OL,6,FSales of essential goods such as
OL,7,Fbottled water and canned food soared in
OL,8,Fthe 10 days following the launch of the
OL,9,Fgovernment's "Be Ready" emergency
OL,10,Fpreparedness campaign on 22 October,
OL,11,Fresearch indicates.
OL,13,FHand sanitiser sales were up 83%, sales
OL,14,Fof bottled water rose 67% and tinned
OL,15,Fand jarred goods climbed 37%, according
OL,16,Fto data from retail research firm
OL,17,FWorldpanel by Numerator.
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
